From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: elaina <elaina@k230>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 15:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] drm: canaan: use supported RGB565 for fbdev console

The K230 primary OSD plane does not advertise XRGB8888, which is selected
by fbdev's 32 bpp preference. RGB565 is supported by both the plane and VO.

---
 drivers/gpu/drm/canaan/canaan_drv.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/canaan/canaan_drv.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/canaan/canaan_drv.c
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/canaan/canaan_drv.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/canaan/canaan_drv.c
@@ -269,7 +269,7 @@ static int canaan_drm_bind(struct device *dev)
 		goto finish_poll;
 	}
 
-	drm_fbdev_generic_setup(drm_dev, 32);
+	drm_fbdev_generic_setup(drm_dev, 16);
 	DRM_DEV_INFO(dev, "Canaan K230 DRM driver register successfully\n");
 
 	return 0;
-- 
2.34.1
